# WIP open notes

Each product may have `<product>/.wip/` (gitignored).

- `README.md` — what the folder is for
- `OPEN.md` — living open work, ops gates, rename candidates, recently done

When finishing a non-trivial task or when the user states a plan that must not be lost: update that product’s `OPEN.md` (check off, add, or move items). Do not treat chat as the only store. Do not put secrets in `.wip/`. Do not delete `OPEN.md` unless the user asks.
